akko-5075b

my qmk keymap for the akko 5075b via.

changes
  caps          esc
  shift+caps    caps lock
  sleep         10 min idle on 2.4g/bt, was 2
  lighting      solid keys, flash on press, side strip off
  bootmagic     hold esc while plugging in

requirements
  qmk, arm-none-eabi-gcc, wb32-dfu-updater_cli, gnu make
  (gmake on macos)

build
  make setup    clone akko's qmk fork to ~/qmk_akko, once
  make          build
  make flash    build and flash; fn+rshift+esc for the bootloader

files
  keymap/       keymap.c, config.h, rules.mk
  sleep.patch   applied to akko's tree before each build

notes
  hold fn+~ for 3 s after the first flash to reset settings.
  colors live in keymap/config.h and keymap.c.
  akko's published source doesn't build as-is; keymap.c stubs
  the missing symbols.

gpl-2.0-or-later
